{"unit_id":"Cocowwy__dsh-plugin-question-navigator#feature-1","repo":"Cocowwy/dsh-plugin-question-navigator","commit":"4bc17a2e0536989a8d49991f6a6c5009b05dec87","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Question Navigator 的功能「定位最近提问」：单击浮动按钮可将当前会话最新一条已渲染的用户消息平滑滚动到阅读区域上方；按钮仅在离开对话底部且存在用户消息时出现。 通过对话中的导航按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:109-125"]}
{"unit_id":"Cocowwy__dsh-plugin-question-navigator#feature-2","repo":"Cocowwy/dsh-plugin-question-navigator","commit":"4bc17a2e0536989a8d49991f6a6c5009b05dec87","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Question Navigator 的功能「逐条回看更早问题」：完成最近提问定位后，按钮会按消息顺序逐条定位更早的用户消息；到达最早一条后按钮禁用，避免继续跳转。 通过对话中的导航按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:110-135"]}
{"unit_id":"Cocowwy__dsh-plugin-question-navigator#feature-3","repo":"Cocowwy/dsh-plugin-question-navigator","commit":"4bc17a2e0536989a8d49991f6a6c5009b05dec87","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Question Navigator 的功能「适配动态加载历史」：组件监听对话内容变化并重新收集带消息身份标记的用户消息，因此新渲染的历史记录会纳入导航候选。 通过对话中的导航按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:98-110"]}
{"unit_id":"Cocowwy__dsh-plugin-question-navigator#feature-4","repo":"Cocowwy/dsh-plugin-question-navigator","commit":"4bc17a2e0536989a8d49991f6a6c5009b05dec87","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Question Navigator 的功能「中英文与窄屏控件」：按钮标签根据页面或浏览器语言切换中英文；窄屏时隐藏文字，仅保留图标按钮。 通过对话中的导航按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:15-35"]}
